CONNECT p60485-2.axle9 -> p32054-3.axlehole1 LOCKED
CONNECT p32054-1.pin1 -> p32524-1.hole7 STIFF
CONNECT p32054-4.pin1 -> p32524-2.hole1 STIFF
WHY Builds two nine-length side shafts with grey long-pin sockets at their ends and perpendicular handles at their centres, then plugs them into the outer grey beams.
STEP 5
ADD p32316-1 32316 lightgray
